<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables - Western Digital.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables - Western Digital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Monday that Western Digital Corp was not available for after-hours trading for news.</p>
<p>Traders said earlier that the company was trading at 71 against a close of 68-3/8 in the after-hours session.</p>
<p>Western said second-quarter earnings totalled $1.35 a share against $0.75 for the same period last year.  </p>
<p>The exchange said Corimon SACA CRM.CR, Westmoreland Coal Co and Westmoreland preferred A stock WCXpA.N were also unavailable for trading.</p>
</text>
